# A folder's menu in Arc 1.174's order: Share Folder… ─ New Nested Folder…, Copy All Links, Copy All
# Links as Markdown ─ Change Icon…, Icon Color ▸ (Cra's), Rename… ─ Move to ▸ ─ Delete. The copy rows
# are dimmed on an empty folder; on Reading they copy every tab inside, the nested folder's too, with
# trackers left out.
budget rss=800 stalls50=10
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "showToolbar": false}
